From c25df7d4be35e05c2e9356d76c50598e698d58df Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: davmels <davmelous@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 07:37:00 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] Apertus 2 format: serve it on the chat endpoint for Gym

Gym talks to vLLM over the chat endpoint, in text. With output_format apertus2
the prompt is encoded with apertus-common and the format's token mask applies.
The response carries the reply as content and the thinking as reasoning, both
parsed from the generated tokens. An output without a reply finishes as length,
so that Gym treats it as a reply cut off by the token limit.
